			<TRAN tranid="obpds_srvc_333r" trcode="obpds_srvc_333r" compress="1" encryption="1" inputcheck="1" useattr="0" />
		</TRID_INFO>
		<TRIO_INFO>
			<TRAN name="obpds_srvc_070r" title="약정고객정보조회 TR" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="39" _ulen="31" >

ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" inout="out" _len="350" _ulen="266" >

ETC_CNTT^기타 내용^100^0^0^0^0^0^0
CSNO^고객번호^10^0^0^0^0^0^0
CSNM^고객명^40^0^0^0^0^0^0
RCNO^실명확인번호^13^0^0^0^0^0^0
CUST_CLS_CODE^고객 구분 코드^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
CUST_GRAD_CODE^고객 등급 코드^2^0^0^0^0^0^0
RSDT_CLS_CODE^거주자 구분 코드^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
MANG_BRCD^관리 지점코드^4^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
			</TRAN>
			<TRAN name="obpds_srvc_069r" title="약정내역조회 TR" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="221" _ulen="167" >

CSNO^고객번호^10^0^0^0^0^0^0
SVCD^서비스코드^3^0^0^0^0^0^0
ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
PROS_CLS_CODE^처리 구분 코드^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
STPL_STAT_CLS_CODE^약정 상태 구분 코드^2^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" occurs="30" inout="out" _len="1355" _ulen="1015" >

CSNO^고객번호^10^0^0^0^0^0^0
SVCD^서비스코드^3^0^0^0^0^0^0
SVC_SRNO^서비스 일련번호^11^0^7^0^0^0^0
